{#
  Filament DB sidebar content. OctoPrint supplies the accordion-group
  wrapper (id="sidebar_plugin_filamentdb") -- this template is content
  only, never the container. See docs/prd.md "OctoPrint UI framework".

  Bound (custom_bindings) to static/js/filamentdb.js's FilamentDBViewModel.
  The spool list itself is a later step (FR-2); the placeholder line below
  stands in for it until then.

  The odometer block is this step's actual instrument (FR-5 UI): raw
  millimetres per tool, live during a print. Only OctoPrint/Bootstrap
  semantic classes -- no hardcoded colour (docs/prd.md "Looking native").
#}
<div class="filamentdb-sidebar">
    <p class="muted" data-bind="text: placeholderText"></p>

    <div data-bind="visible: hasOdometerData">
        <p class="muted" data-bind="visible: odometerPrinting">
            printing -- live raw extrusion
        </p>
        <p class="muted" data-bind="visible: !odometerPrinting()">
            stopped -- final raw extrusion this job
        </p>
        <table class="table table-condensed filamentdb-odometer">
            <tbody data-bind="foreach: odometerRows">
                <tr>
                    <td data-bind="text: label"></td>
                    <td class="text-right" data-bind="text: mmText"></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>
